                'tier' => ContentTier::FREE,
                'skill_level' => SkillLevel::INTERMEDIATE,
                'duration' => 8,
                'key_takeaways' => [
                    'The Central Depository Company (CDC) acts as the electronic vault holding all Pakistani stock shares.',
                    'A Broker Sub-Account is opened automatically when you open a trading account with a licensed PSX brokerage.',
                    'A direct CDC Investor Account (IAS) provides maximum security because only you hold authorization to move or pledge shares.',
